= Solution
{parent=a}

**This sequence cannot occur.** <Poincare duality> and the <universal coefficient theorem for cohomology> imply
$$
H_3(M;\mathbb Z)\cong H^1(M;\mathbb Z)\cong\operatorname{Hom}(H_1(M;\mathbb Z),\mathbb Z)=0.
$$
Thus a nonzero rank-two third <homology> group is incompatible with the proposed first <homology> group.

= b
{parent=3}
